# SPA fallback is provided by assets.notFoundHandling
# single-page-application in cloudflare.config.ts, which serves index.html
# for unknown paths so the Blazor router renders its own NotFound UI.
# The old Pages rule (/* /index.html 200) is rejected by Workers Static
# Assets as an infinite loop, so it must not live here. 404.html mirrors
# index.html so a future 404 rule still renders the app shell with a 404
# status. The tradeoff stays the same: unknown paths return 200 instead
# of 404, which search engines call a soft 404.
